<!-- HeapScope's own icons (ADR-040): Duotone on a 20 px grid, drawn by Controls/DuotoneIcon. Icon.Name.Line is the outline, in the
     text color; Icon.Name.Tint, where there is one, is filled with the accent's tint. Logo.Mark is logo A, the app's logo;
     Logo.Small is its simplified form for 20 px and under. Fixed colors: a logo stays the same in both themes. -->
